    "The TR-03183-2 checks read CycloneDX 1.6 and later, field by field, as rio's profile does. Neither tool reads SPDX for the TR, so there is no verdict here. A conversion to CycloneDX would be judged like any CycloneDX file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The TR-03183-2 checks read CycloneDX 1.6 and later, field by field, as rio's profile does. Neither tool reads SPDX for the TR, so there is no verdict here. A conversion to CycloneDX would be judged like any CycloneDX file."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Prüfungen nach TR-03183-2 lesen CycloneDX 1.6 und neuer, Feld für Feld, wie das Profil von rio. Keines der beiden Werkzeuge liest SPDX für die TR, daher gibt es hier kein Urteil. Eine Konvertierung nach CycloneDX würde wie jede CycloneDX-Datei beurteilt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
